
# J.A.R.V.I.S. 🤖

### Just A Rather Very Intelligent System

A personal AI assistant built with Python and a locally running Large Language Model (LLM). JARVIS uses Ollama and Qwen 2.5 3B to generate intelligent responses without requiring paid AI APIs.

## ✨ Current Features

- Local AI inference using Ollama
- Qwen 2.5 3B language model
- Custom AI personality
- Interactive terminal-based chat
- Conversation history during a session
- Clear conversation memory
- Offline AI responses after model download

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Python | Core application |
| Ollama | Local LLM runtime |
| Qwen 2.5 3B | AI language model |
| Requests | Communication with Ollama |
| SQLite | Planned persistent memory |

